    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tactical Hex-Based Gameplay</strong><br><br>Engage in deep, strategic gameplay as you gather resources, build fortifications, and marshal your forces in this turn-based strategy game. Each match is kept fresh and unpredictable as you gather faith and use abilities that can change the nature of events on the battlefield.<br><br><strong>Competitive Multiplayer</strong><br><br>Compete against fellow players in a quick-paced but tactical battle to wrest control of the aurin crystals and power your lodestone before the other player.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/52dbb4c9f6411098b6f116fcc570f2a5.poster.avif?t=1695425873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/52dbb4c9f6411098b6f116fcc570f2a5.webm?t=1695425873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/52dbb4c9f6411098b6f116fcc570f2a5.mp4?t=1695425873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story-Driven Singleplayer</strong><br><br>Explore the ancient conflict between the noble Sentinels and the infernal hordes of The Fallen as you fight over The Crossing, a breach in the impenetrable barrier that has separated the two forces for hundreds of years.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/f37abdf58940c3255ed2858c99247fb4.avif?t=1695425873\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Tactical Hex-Based Gameplay</strong><br><br>Engage in deep, strategic gameplay as you gather resources, build fortifications, and marshal your forces in this turn-based strategy game. Each match is kept fresh and unpredictable as you gather faith and use abilities that can change the nature of events on the battlefield.<br><br><strong>Competitive Multiplayer</strong><br><br>Compete against fellow players in a quick-paced but tactical battle to wrest control of the aurin crystals and power your lodestone before the other player.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/52dbb4c9f6411098b6f116fcc570f2a5.poster.avif?t=1695425873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/52dbb4c9f6411098b6f116fcc570f2a5.webm?t=1695425873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/52dbb4c9f6411098b6f116fcc570f2a5.mp4?t=1695425873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story-Driven Singleplayer</strong><br><br>Explore the ancient conflict between the noble Sentinels and the infernal hordes of The Fallen as you fight over The Crossing, a breach in the impenetrable barrier that has separated the two forces for hundreds of years.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344180/extras/f37abdf58940c3255ed2858c99247fb4.avif?t=1695425873\" /></span>",
